  <ThingDef ParentName="BOR_QualityArmorBase_II">
    <defName>BOR_Quasar_Convergence_Gauntlets</defName>
    <label>kwazaari convergence gauntlets</label>
    <description>Structured gauntlets with a layered guidance system built from kwazaari alloy. The inner haptic mesh assists with neutronium substrate handling during synthesis, while the reinforced outer shell keeps hand position locked during bionic implant installation. The quality of the craft determines how precisely the two systems work in tandem.</description>
